  <!-- EN: Quest expired: [resolvedQuestName] -->
  <OpportunitySite_BanditCamp.LetterLabelQuestExpired.slateRef>La misión expiró: [resolvedQuestName]</OpportunitySite_BanditCamp.LetterLabelQuestExpired.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: The bandit camp has packed up and moved on. The quest [resolvedQuestName] has expired. -->
  <OpportunitySite_BanditCamp.LetterTextQuestExpired.slateRef>El campamento de bandidos ha empacado y ha seguido adelante. La misión [resolvedQuestName] ha expirado.</OpportunitySite_BanditCamp.LetterTextQuestExpired.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: Quest failed: [resolvedQuestName] -->
  <OpportunitySite_BanditCamp.LetterLabelQuestFailed.slateRef>Misión fallida: [resolvedQuestName]</OpportunitySite_BanditCamp.LetterLabelQuestFailed.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: After being discovered, the bandit camp has dispersed. The quest [resolvedQuestName] has ended. -->
  <OpportunitySite_BanditCamp.LetterTextQuestFailed.slateRef>Después de haber sido descubiertos, el campamento bandido empacó sus cosas y se fue. La misión [resolvedQuestName] ha terminado.</OpportunitySite_BanditCamp.LetterTextQuestFailed.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: Payment arrived -->
  <OpportunitySite_BanditCamp.LetterLabelPaymentArrived.slateRef>El pago ha llegado</OpportunitySite_BanditCamp.LetterLabelPaymentArrived.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: You have defeated the bandit camp!\n\nThe payment from [asker_faction_name] has arrived. -->
  <OpportunitySite_BanditCamp.LetterTextPaymentArrived.slateRef>¡Has derrotado al campamento de bandidos!\n\nEl pago por ayudar a la facción [asker_faction_name] ha llegado.</OpportunitySite_BanditCamp.LetterTextPaymentArrived.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: [asker_faction_royalFavorLabel] -->
  <OpportunitySite_BanditCamp.LetterLabelFavorReceiver.slateRef>[asker_faction_royalFavorLabel]</OpportunitySite_BanditCamp.LetterLabelFavorReceiver.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: These colonists participated in the victory for the quest [resolvedQuestName]. [asker_definite] wants to know who should receive the [royalFavorReward_amount] [asker_faction_royalFavorLabel] for this service. -->
  <OpportunitySite_BanditCamp.LetterTextFavorReceiver.slateRef>Estos colonos participaron en la victoria de la misión [resolvedQuestName]. [asker_definite] quiere saber quién debe recibir los [royalFavorReward_amount] de [asker_faction_royalFavorLabel] por este servicio.</OpportunitySite_BanditCamp.LetterTextFavorReceiver.slateRef>
  
